    "api_error_status": null,
    "result": "## Summary\n\n\u2705 **Fixed the bug!** The issue was that the parent `frai` command was consuming the `--ci` flag, preventing it from being passed through to the `frai-gate` CLI.\n\n### What was changed:\n**File: `packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts`** (lines 737-760)\n\nThe gate command's action handler now:\n1. Receives the `command` object as a third parameter\n2. Accesses the parent command's options via `command.parent?.opts()`\n3. Checks if the parent's `--ci` flag is set\n4. If true, appends `--ci` to the arguments passed to the frai-gate CLI\n\n### Verification:\n- Rebuilt with `pnpm --filter frai build` \u2713\n- Tested `frai gate init --ci` which now correctly creates:\n  - `FRAI-SPEC.md` \u2713\n  - `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml` \u2713\n\nThe fix is clean, minimal, and doesn't modify the frai-gate package as requested.",
